 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "ObjectLayout(names, sizes) packs the fields in order from byte 0 with no gaps (field i has sizes[i] > 0 bytes). getOffset(name) returns the first byte of the field, or -1 when there is no such field. fieldAt(offset) returns the name of the field covering that byte, or \"\" when the offset is at or beyond the total size. totalSize() returns the sum of sizes. addField(name, size) appends a new field at the end and returns true, or returns false (and changes nothing) when the name exists. removeField(name) deletes the field and closes the gap, shifting later fields down, and returns true, or returns false when absent. Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
    "revision": null,
    "path": "projects/algorithm_solver/catalogue/authored/hack2hire-chunk16-b-20261028-v1/contracts.json",
    "sha256": "ef595baa726fe122f77d21702cda14f53d9cc1bd35fe6353ecc37f97e383e98a",
    "selector": "/problems/8/inferred_spec"
   }
  ]
 },
